    "answer": "`queueTicket`, in `libs/shared/src/work/backlog/queue-ticket.ts`. It adds the default `priority:medium` label when the issue has no priority label. It then comments that the issue is queued, or that the loop is switched off for the repo. `dispatchLabeledIssue` (`libs/shared/src/work/backlog/label-dispatch.ts`) is the entry point that calls it when an issue gets the dispatch label. `dispatchLabeledIssue` first checks that no task already holds the issue.",
